{"parse":{"title":"HPL3/SOMA/Getting Started","pageid":3426,"revid":7120,"text":{"*":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div style=\"position:relative;margin:0 0 1em 1em;float:right;\">\n<div class=\"navbox\" style=\"border:2px solid #525252; text-align:left;background:#323232;\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center; padding:.6em; background-color:#262626; border-bottom: 2px solid #262626; font-size:1em;position:relative;z-index:1\"><b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">SOMA Getting Started</a></b></div>\n<div class=\"navbox-text\" style=\"position:relative; padding:.8em 3.2em .8em .8em; z-index:1;\">\n<p><span>\n</span></p>\n<ol><li><a href=\"/page/HPL3/SOMA/Getting_Started/Prepare_Your_Tools\" title=\"HPL3/SOMA/Getting Started/Prepare Your Tools\">Prepare Your Tools</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/HPL3/SOMA/Getting_Started/Create_and_Launch_Your_Mod\" title=\"HPL3/SOMA/Getting Started/Create and Launch Your Mod\">Create and Launch Your Mod</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/HPL3/SOMA/Getting_Started/Configure_the_Level_Editor\" title=\"HPL3/SOMA/Getting Started/Configure the Level Editor\">Configure the Level Editor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/HPL3/SOMA/Getting_Started/Edit_Your_First_Map\" title=\"HPL3/SOMA/Getting Started/Edit Your First Map\">Edit Your First Map</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/HPL3/SOMA/Getting_Started/Add_Your_First_Script\" title=\"HPL3/SOMA/Getting Started/Add Your First Script\">Add Your First Script</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/HPL3/SOMA/Getting_Started/Test_Debug_and_Continue\" title=\"HPL3/SOMA/Getting Started/Test Debug and Continue\">Test, Debug, and Continue</a></li></ol>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>This guide takes you from a working installation of <i>SOMA</i> to a stand-alone mod with a map you can edit and a script you have changed yourself. It uses the <code>MinimalCustomMapMod</code> included with the game, so you begin with a known-working configuration instead of assembling every file from scratch.\n</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #4a4a44; border: 1px solid #ffc400; padding: 12px;\">\n<div><img alt=\"Icon tip.png\" src=\"/nsfr_img_auth.php/b/be/Icon_tip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" />\nTip: Complete the steps in order. Each step ends with a checkpoint. Do not continue until the checkpoint works; this keeps configuration, map, and script problems separate.</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2>Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#What_you_will_make\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">What you will make</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#The_path\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The path</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Ground_rules\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ground rules</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#If_you_are_already_experienced\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">If you are already experienced</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"What_you_will_make\">What you will make</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/page?title=HPL3/SOMA/Getting_Started&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: What you will make\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the end of this path, you will have:\n</p>\n<ul><li>your own mod folder, separate from the bundled example and the base game;</li>\n<li>a stand-alone mod that starts directly in its map;</li>\n<li>the Level Editor configured to work on that mod;</li>\n<li>a saved change to an HPL3 <code>.hpm</code> map; and</li>\n<li>a changed <code>.hps</code> map script which displays <code>Hello World!</code> in-game.</li></ul>\n<p>No previous HPL modding experience is required. Basic programming knowledge is helpful for the scripting step, but not required for completing it.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_path\">The path</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/page?title=HPL3/SOMA/Getting_Started&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: The path\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:5%\">Step\n</th>\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>You are finished when...\n</th>\n<th>Detailed reading\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/page/HPL3/SOMA/Getting_Started/Prepare_Your_Tools\" title=\"HPL3/SOMA/Getting Started/Prepare Your Tools\">Prepare your tools</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><i>SOMA</i>, the Level Editor, and a text editor are ready.\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/page/HPL3/SOMA/Modding\" title=\"HPL3/SOMA/Modding\">SOMA Modding</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/page/HPL3/SOMA/Getting_Started/Create_and_Launch_Your_Mod\" title=\"HPL3/SOMA/Getting Started/Create and Launch Your Mod\">Create and launch your mod</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>Your copied mod appears in the launcher and its sample map starts.\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/page/HPL3/SOMA/Modding/Creating_a_Mod\" title=\"HPL3/SOMA/Modding/Creating a Mod\">Creating a Mod</a>; <a href=\"/page/HPL3/SOMA/Modding/MinimalCustomMapMod\" title=\"HPL3/SOMA/Modding/MinimalCustomMapMod\">MinimalCustomMapMod</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/page/HPL3/SOMA/Getting_Started/Configure_the_Level_Editor\" title=\"HPL3/SOMA/Getting Started/Configure the Level Editor\">Configure the Level Editor</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>The editor title bar says <code>(Working on mod)</code>.\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/page/HPL3/SOMA/Modding/Setup_Modding_Environment\" title=\"HPL3/SOMA/Modding/Setup Modding Environment\">Setup Modding Environment</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/page/HPL3/SOMA/Getting_Started/Edit_Your_First_Map\" title=\"HPL3/SOMA/Getting Started/Edit Your First Map\">Edit your first map</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>A visible map change survives saving, closing, and reopening the editor.\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/page/HPL3/SOMA/Level_Design\" title=\"HPL3/SOMA/Level Design\">Level Design</a>; <a href=\"/page/HPL3/SOMA/Level_Design/Level_Editor_View\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"HPL3/SOMA/Level Design/Level Editor View\">Level Editor View</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/page/HPL3/SOMA/Getting_Started/Add_Your_First_Script\" title=\"HPL3/SOMA/Getting Started/Add Your First Script\">Add your first script</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><code>Hello World!</code> appears when the map starts.\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/page/HPL3/Scripting/Scripting_Guide/Scripting_Workflow_and_Structure\" title=\"HPL3/Scripting/Scripting Guide/Scripting Workflow and Structure\">Scripting Workflow and Structure</a>; <a href=\"/page/HPL3/Scripting/Scripting_Guide/Hello_World\" title=\"HPL3/Scripting/Scripting Guide/Hello World\">Hello World</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/page/HPL3/SOMA/Getting_Started/Test_Debug_and_Continue\" title=\"HPL3/SOMA/Getting Started/Test Debug and Continue\">Test, debug, and continue</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>You can reload the map, find script errors, and choose the next documentation section.\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/page/HPL3/SOMA/Modding/Developer_Debug_Menu\" title=\"HPL3/SOMA/Modding/Developer Debug Menu\">Developer Debug Menu</a>; <a href=\"/page/HPL3/SOMA/Developer_Commands\" title=\"HPL3/SOMA/Developer Commands\">Developer Commands</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ground_rules\">Ground rules</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/page?title=HPL3/SOMA/Getting_Started&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Ground rules\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Work in your mod folder.</b> Do not edit base-game files or the original <code>MinimalCustomMapMod</code>.</li>\n<li><b>Use relative resource paths.</b> Your mod should not depend on another user's installation path.</li>\n<li><b>Keep the whole map together.</b> An HPL3 map consists of the main <code>.hpm</code> file and its accompanying <code>.hpm_*</code> files. Do not treat it as an old HPL2 <code>.map</code> file.</li>\n<li><b>Test one change at a time.</b> First launch the untouched copy, then configure the editor, then edit the map, then edit the script.</li>\n<li><b>Keep names simple at first.</b> Use letters, numbers, and underscores for folders, maps, and object names.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"If_you_are_already_experienced\">If you are already experienced</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/page?title=HPL3/SOMA/Getting_Started&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: If you are already experienced\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The table above is the complete route. You can skip directly to any checkpoint and use the linked articles as reference. The step pages intentionally contain only the minimum context, action, expected result, and recovery information needed for a first successful mod.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260828180349\nCache expiry: 86400\nDynamic content: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 102/1000000\nPreprocessor generated node count: 0/1000000\nPost\u2010expand include size: 2791/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 749/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 6/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post\u2010expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    2.279      1 -total\n 69.93%    1.594      1 Template:Hpl3SomaGettingStarted\n 39.05%    0.890      1 Template:MenuBox\n 28.31%    0.645      1 Template:Tip\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki:pcache:idhash:3426-0!canonical and timestamp 20260828180349 and revision id 7120\n -->\n</div>"},"links":[{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"HPL3/SOMA/Developer Commands"},{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"HPL3/SOMA/Getting Started/Add Your First Script"},{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"HPL3/SOMA/Getting Started/Configure the Level Editor"},{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"HPL3/SOMA/Getting Started/Create and Launch Your Mod"},{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"HPL3/SOMA/Getting Started/Edit Your First Map"},{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"HPL3/SOMA/Getting Started/Prepare Your Tools"},{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"HPL3/SOMA/Getting Started/Test Debug and Continue"},{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"HPL3/SOMA/Level Design"},{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"HPL3/SOMA/Level Design/Level Editor View"},{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"HPL3/SOMA/Modding"},{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"HPL3/SOMA/Modding/Creating a Mod"},{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"HPL3/SOMA/Modding/Developer Debug Menu"},{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"HPL3/SOMA/Modding/MinimalCustomMapMod"},{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"HPL3/SOMA/Modding/Setup Modding Environment"},{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"HPL3/Scripting/Scripting Guide/Hello World"},{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"HPL3/Scripting/Scripting Guide/Scripting Workflow and Structure"}],"templates":[{"ns":10,"exists":"","*":"Template:Hpl3SomaGettingStarted"},{"ns":10,"exists":"","*":"Template:MenuBox"},{"ns":10,"exists":"","*":"Template:Tip"}],"images":["Icon_tip.png"],"displaytitle":"HPL3/SOMA/Getting Started"}}